Start
===
3 to 5 of:
    - dark
    - eerie
    - scary
    - mysterious
    - ominous
    - foreboding
    - haunting
    - shadowy
    - unsettling
    - desolate
    - abandoned
    - cold blue light
    - long shadows
    - creeping fog
    - flickering light
    - an unseen presence
    - deathly stillness
    - gnarled shapes
    - peeling decay
    - a single lit window
    - cobwebs
    - dead leaves
    - a blood-red moon
    - whispering darkness
